{
  "id": "Lyo.Job.Web.Components",
  "name": "Lyo.Job.Web.Components",
  "area": "Integration",
  "tagline": "Blazor / MudBlazor dashboard for the Lyo job-management stack. Drop `JobManagement` into a host page for Statistics, Definitions, Schedules, Runs (with **progress** and **SLA breach** indicators)…",
  "description": "Blazor / MudBlazor dashboard for the Lyo job-management stack. Drop `JobManagement` into a host page for Statistics, Definitions, Schedules, Runs (with **progress** and **SLA breach** indicators), **worker registry**, and **workflow** views — all using an injected `IApiClient` and configurable base route prefix.\n\nPair with [`Lyo.Job.SignalR`](../Lyo.Job.SignalR/README.md) for a live-updating dashboard that receives `JobEvent` broadcasts without polling.\n\nAll components target server-side or interactive Blazor in `net10.0` and pull in MudBlazor `>= 9.3`.\n\nThis package is a **Razor component library** — it has no `AddXxx` DI registration. The host must already register `IApiClient` (and optionally [ `Lyo.Job.SignalR`](../Lyo.Job.SignalR/README.md) for live updates).",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Architecture",
      "language": "mermaid",
      "code": "flowchart LR\n    UI[JobManagement tabs] --> API[IApiClient → Job API]\n    UI -. optional .-> SR[SignalR JobHub]\n    SR --> MQ[job.events exchange]\n    MQ --> API"
    },
    {
      "title": "Live dashboard (SignalR)",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "// Program.cs\nservices.AddJobSignalR();\nvar app = builder.Build();\napp.MapJobHub(); // default /hubs/job"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top-level entry point",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Notes"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`BaseRoute`",
          "Route prefix for job endpoints. Required. Defaults to `\"Job\"`."
        ],
        [
          "`StatisticsRoute`",
          "Optional URL returning `SpJobStatistic` rows. When omitted, the stats tab shows an info alert."
        ]
      ],
      "lead": "```razor\n@using Lyo.Job.Web.Components\n\n<JobManagement BaseRoute=\"Job\" StatisticsRoute=\"api/job-stats/recent\" />\n```",
      "trail": "`JobManagement` renders tabbed `MudTabs`: Statistics, Definitions, Schedules, Runs, Workers, Workflows."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "title": "Live dashboard (SignalR)",
      "body": "For real-time run/alert/definition updates, register SignalR in the host and subscribe from your page:\n\n\n\n```javascript\n// Client-side (example)\nconnection.on(\"JobEvent\", (evt) => { /* refresh grids or patch rows */ });\n```\n\nSee [`Lyo.Job.SignalR`](../Lyo.Job.SignalR/README.md) for event types (`run.created`, `run.finished`, `alert`, …)."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Component catalog",
      "headers": [
        "Component",
        "Role"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`JobManagement`",
          "Tabbed dashboard shell."
        ],
        [
          "`JobStats`",
          "Aggregated `SpJobStatistic` success rates and counts."
        ],
        [
          "`JobDefinitionGrid`",
          "CRUD grid for definitions."
        ],
        [
          "`JobDefinitionView`",
          "Editor: parameters, schedules, triggers."
        ],
        [
          "`JobScheduleGrid`",
          "Standalone schedule CRUD (misfire, calendar, cron fields via API)."
        ],
        [
          "`JobParameterView`",
          "Definition parameter grid (including encrypted markers, AllowedValues, and Options editor)."
        ],
        [
          "`JobScheduleView`",
          "Inline schedule editor on definition view."
        ],
        [
          "`JobTriggerView`",
          "Trigger relationships between definitions."
        ],
        [
          "`JobRunGrid`",
          "Runs with state pills, **progress bar** column, drill-down."
        ],
        [
          "`JobRunDetailView`",
          "Parameters, results, logs, **progress**, **SLA breach** chip, alert flags, re-run."
        ],
        [
          "`JobWorkerInstanceGrid`",
          "Live worker registry (type, machine, PID, in-flight, heartbeat)."
        ],
        [
          "`JobWorkflowView`",
          "Workflow picker + ordered step diagram."
        ],
        [
          "`RunJobDialog`",
          "Ad-hoc run with parameter overrides; Options / AllowedValues render as MudSelect with live sibling binding."
        ]
      ],
      "trail": "Every grid / view accepts `IApiClient` and route parameters so components can be hosted independently of the full shell."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Production hardening in the UI",
      "headers": [
        "Feature",
        "Where surfaced"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Progress",
          "`JobRunGrid` progress column; `JobRunDetailView` linear bar + message"
        ],
        [
          "SLA",
          "`JobRunDetailView` breach indicator when `SlaBreached == true`"
        ],
        [
          "Alerting",
          "Definition/run alert flags in detail view"
        ],
        [
          "Worker registry",
          "**Workers** tab (`JobWorkerInstanceGrid`)"
        ],
        [
          "Workflows",
          "**Workflows** tab (`JobWorkflowView`)"
        ],
        [
          "Schedules / blackout calendars",
          "**Schedules** tab — misfire policy, linked `JobBlackoutCalendarId`, cron fields via API"
        ],
        [
          "Dry run",
          "`RunJobDialog` can pass `DryRun` for validate-only runs (no worker dispatch)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "`JobColorHelper`",
      "headers": [
        "Member",
        "Returns / behavior"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`ForState(JobState)`",
          "MudBlazor `Color` mapping."
        ],
        [
          "`ForResult(JobRunResult?)`",
          "Success / warning / error colors."
        ],
        [
          "`ForLogLevel(JobLogLevel)`",
          "Trace/Debug→Default, Info→Info, Warning→Warning, Error/Critical→Error."
        ],
        [
          "`StateIcon` / `ResultIcon`",
          "Material icon names."
        ],
        [
          "`FormatDuration` / `FormatDurationFromDates`",
          "Human-readable durations."
        ],
        [
          "`GetEnumDescription<T>(T value)`",
          "`[Description]` attribute or field name."
        ]
      ],
      "lead": "Static helper for consistent visual treatment of job state, result, and log level."
    }
  ],
